+## The daily usage report
+
+Each organization gets yesterday's report by email at 9:00 (Paris time by default,
+`WORKPILOT_REPORT_TIMEZONE`), in French (`WORKPILOT_REPORT_LANGUAGE`), sent to its owners and
+administrators: token use and cost, the share of the monthly budget, active, new and dormant
+people, runs, failures, merged tasks and cost per delivered task, each beside the day before and
+the 7-day average, then the top consumers, providers and models, why runs failed and the budget
+alerts at 80 % and 100 %. **Administration → Usage → Report** sets the time to the minute, the
+time zone, the days, up to 20 addresses (one outside the organization is flagged), the language,
+names or not, and weekly or monthly reports; each change is audited. A report goes once, even
+across a restart, and needs the server's SMTP; without it, the report is read in the app.
+
